.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Build and/or query lookup tables for thermodynamic properties of halite (crystalline NaCl) 


.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
Thomas Driesner, ETH Zuerich 
.RE
.PP
.SH "Contact"
